start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {dc ch [2dc ch]x5}@ring join fo
R2: {3ch=dc dc ch 2dc}@sp ch [{2dc ch 2dc}@sp ch]x5 join fo
R3: [3dc@sp ch]x12 join fo
R4: {3ch=dc dc ch 2dc}@sp ch [{2dc ch 2dc}@sp ch]x11 join fo
R5: {3ch=dc dc}@sp ch [2dc@sp ch]x23 join fo
R6: {3ch=dc 2dc} ch [3dc@sp ch]x23 join fo
R7: {2ch=dc} 3ch [sc@sp 3ch]x23 join
R8: ss@sp ch {2ch=sc 2sc}@same ch [{2sc hdc}@sp ch {hdc 2dc}@sp ch {3tr 2ch 3tr}@sp ch {2dc hdc}@sp ch {hdc 2sc}@sp ch 3sc@sp ch]x3 {2sc hdc}@sp ch {hdc 2dc}@sp ch {3tr 2ch 3tr}@sp ch {2dc hdc}@sp ch {hdc 2sc}@sp ch join # last repeat ends at the starting 3 sc
R9: 2ss ss@sp 3ch=dc 2dc@same ch [3dc@sp ch]>corner [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner ch [3dc@sp ch]x6]x4 join fo
